OL,3,GNEWSADamaged Douglas Promenade
OL,4,Acrossings to be replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FDamaged pedestrian crossings on
OL,7,FDouglas's Loch Promenade are to be
OL,8,Freplaced this month.
OL,10,FAreas of the block paving have sunk and
OL,11,Fa number of bricks have been damaged,
OL,12,Fthe Department of Infrastructure said.
OL,14,FWork on crossings near Victoria Street
OL,15,Fand Regent Street is due to begin on 19
OL,16,FOctober and is expected to take about
OL,17,Ftwo weeks.
OL,19,FThe department said asphalt would be
OL,20,Fused as a temporary safety measure
OL,21,Funtil the crossings can be replaced
OL,22,Fwith granite.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
